&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain runbooks, incident response playbooks, and platform documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analyst enablement by improving platform reliability, query performance, and data accessibility across global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest and implement improvements to team tooling, processes, and operational practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
